  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut zucchini into thick half-moons. Cut sweet potato into bite-sized chunks.\n• Place on the lined oven tray. Sprinkle over 1/2 the garlic seasoning, drizzle with olive oil and season with salt and pepper.\n• Toss to coat, spread out evenly and roast until tender, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66ebcf9e8e45e3ca00863382-c503233b.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop brown onion. Finely chop or crush garlic.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook onion until softened, 3-4 mins. Cook garlic until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Stir in the water, risotto-style rice, the salt and remaining garlic seasoning. Bring to boil, then remove from heat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66ebcf9e8e45e3ca00863382-79f2a086.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Transfer risotto to a large baking dish.\n• Cover tightly with foil and bake until liquid is absorbed and rice is 'al dente', 24-28 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66ebcf9e8e45e3ca00863382-0c5414f5.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Remove risotto from oven and stir through basil pesto and baby spinach until spinach has wilted.\n• Crumble in fetta and gently stir through roasted veggies.\n• Stir through a splash of water to loosen risotto if needed. Season to taste.\n• Divide risotto between bowls. Top with flaked almonds to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66ebcf9e8e45e3ca00863382-fe00c977.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
